WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.888 --> 00:00:07.272
Wedding-parent makeup — on the day itself, regret comes too late

2
00:00:07.608 --> 00:00:10.608
Why we made these 100 questions and answers:

3
00:00:10.944 --> 00:00:12.960
Is this your first time as a wedding parent?

4
00:00:13.296 --> 00:00:18.552
Your child's wedding is joyful and exciting, and yet part of you is probably worried.

5
00:00:18.888 --> 00:00:21.384
"What if the makeup is too heavy?"

6
00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:25.152
"What if I look older, or my face looks wider?"

7
00:00:25.488 --> 00:00:28.464
"Which hairstyle actually suits a hanbok?"

8
00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:32.640
"Will I still look natural and dignified in the photos and video?"

9
00:00:32.976 --> 00:00:36.072
"What do I need to prepare for the wedding day itself?"

10
00:00:36.408 --> 00:00:40.464
Wedding-parent makeup is not simply about making a face pretty.

11
00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:43.896
You are the host who welcomes every guest you invited,

12
00:00:44.232 --> 00:00:49.512
and the way you look that day stays in the family's records for a very long time.

13
00:00:49.848 --> 00:00:52.080
Even so, many wedding parents

14
00:00:52.416 --> 00:00:55.704
choose a makeup shop without enough information,

15
00:00:56.040 --> 00:01:01.848
and end up with a style that doesn't suit their face, their hanbok, or the venue.

16
00:01:02.184 --> 00:01:05.616
That is why we prepared "Wedding-Parent Makeup: 100 Questions, 100 Answers."

17
00:01:05.952 --> 00:01:08.472
Twenty-five years, more than ten thousand people.

18
00:01:08.808 --> 00:01:12.000
Working on makeup for brides, grooms and wedding parents,

19
00:01:12.336 --> 00:01:16.032
we built this from what we saw, heard and learned firsthand,

20
00:01:16.368 --> 00:01:20.664
gathering the questions our wedding parents ask most and answering them one by one.

21
00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:27.528
When to book, which shop to choose, how to prepare your skin and hair,

22
00:01:27.864 --> 00:01:34.128
which hairstyle and accessories go with a hanbok, and what to bring on the day.

23
00:01:34.464 --> 00:01:37.464
From the first booking through to the end of the ceremony,

24
00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:41.376
only the practical information a wedding parent actually needs.

25
00:01:41.712 --> 00:01:45.312
There is no single right answer in wedding-parent makeup.

26
00:01:45.648 --> 00:01:48.888
But there are clear standards that keep you from going wrong.

27
00:01:49.224 --> 00:01:54.312
A middle-aged face differs from a young one in skin, in bone structure, in expression.

28
00:01:54.648 --> 00:01:57.984
This guide is here to raise the quality of your look —

29
00:01:58.320 --> 00:02:02.232
and to protect the money you might otherwise have spent without knowing.

30
00:02:02.568 --> 00:02:04.464
We hope these 100 questions and answers

31
00:02:04.800 --> 00:02:06.960
become a dependable guide for anyone becoming a wedding parent for the first time,

32
00:02:07.296 --> 00:02:11.640
and for anyone unsure where to even begin,

33
00:02:11.976 --> 00:02:15.312
so that on the wedding day you look your most beautiful and dignified

34
00:02:15.648 --> 00:02:18.600
as you bless the road ahead for your child.

35
00:02:18.936 --> 00:02:21.528
That is what we hope this becomes — a practical handbook.

36
00:02:21.864 --> 00:02:24.264
Your child's wedding happens once.

37
00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:28.032
How beautiful you look that day changes with how much you prepared.

38
00:02:28.368 --> 00:02:31.920
Studying the wedding parent's face, understanding the wedding parent's heart —

39
00:02:32.256 --> 00:02:34.800
giving our whole heart to wedding-parent makeup.

40
00:02:35.136 --> 00:02:37.056
This is Makeup for L.
